  SKILL-LANG-RUST-L5

Domain:
  languages/rust

Use:
  writing low-level Rust for embedded and kernel development

Apply:
  architect
  senior
  embedded
  kernel
  bare-metal

Requires:
  SKILL-LANG-RUST-L4
  no-std
  embedded-hal

Avoid:
  std-in-embedded
  unsafe-without-justification
  platform-assumptions
  ignoring-memory-layout

Level:
  L5

Status:
  EXPERIMENTAL

Maturity:
  EMERGING

Risk:
  HIGH

